ies.\n\nWe recognize the resilience, strength, and enduring legacy of Indigenous peoples while reaffirming the importance of education, respect, and cultural awareness.\n\nToday and every day, we celebrate the diversity that strengthens our communities and brings us together. \n\n#IndigenousPeoplesDay #BCC\n#BronxBroncos","created_time":null,"from":null},"video":null,"user":{"id":"17841406822028048","full_name":"Bronx CC Athletics","profile_picture":"https://scontent-dfw5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t51.2885-15/210055709_961197861382577_4747689542934436102_n.jpg?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7d201b&_nc_ohc=GjmPO4eT2CEQ7kNvwFbOoYE&_nc_oc=Adp0yh_Pvl1exqJXA8E8UkNzy3DWJSuMR7Nrcqkohztr05okhZj5HOAyzhtSsaMADqM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.xx&edm=AJ-jyNUEAAAA&oh=00_AQQIMe0NXOnSg09n0trO0nVGB0RtsjUTSmvOuvTzPfXNAw&oe=6B035F61","username":"bronxathletics"},"date":"2026-10-11T18:33:30-05:00","created_time":1791743610.0},{"content_id":"17905258044605455","content_title":"The @bcccuny men's soccer team will look to extend its winning streak to four matches, as the Broncos will host @sunyulstermsoc this afternoon at Ohio Field. Start-time is scheduled for 4:00pm. Let's go Broncos! #MatchDay #bronx  #NJCAARegionXV ##NCAA","content_date":"2026-10-08T09:03:36-05:00","content_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DePGr4-RRuZ/","content_image_url":"https://scontent-dfw5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/840498823_18387170212227401_3323625753708534289_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=ESHBLnnX7JIQ7kNvwEyTvdX&_nc_oc=Adr6-sAI-8o_68v53FzD3a6onzZbk4u1LmDTn6uJLAcbyX6Ft-t48jkE2MGvsxR-6MI&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=AFF3FJ0EAAAA&_nc_gid=ils4CotxPKZRRaWxS-Fp8Q&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQQTU2Gs5nvTZ_huMx_hoIwhBJimWspmHSbhzNdgyeFGwA&oe=6B036965","link":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DePGr4-RRuZ/","id":"17905258044605455","tags":[],"comments":[],"likes":{"count":24},"images":{"thumbnail":null,"low_resolution":{"width":null,"height":null,"url":"https://scontent-dfw5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/840498823_18387170212227401_3323625753708534289_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=ESHBLnnX7JIQ7kNvwEyTvdX&_nc_oc=Adr6-sAI-8o_68v53FzD3a6onzZbk4u1LmDTn6uJLAcbyX6Ft-t48jkE2MGvsxR-6MI&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=AFF3FJ0EAAAA&_nc_gid=ils4CotxPKZRRaWxS-Fp8Q&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQQTU2Gs5nvTZ_huMx_hoIwhBJimWspmHSbhzNdgyeFGwA&oe=6B036965"},"standard_resolution":{"width":null,"height":null,"url":"https://scontent-dfw5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/840498823_18387170212227401_3323625753708534289_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=ESHBLnnX7JIQ7kNvwEyTvdX&_nc_oc=Adr6-sAI-8o_68v53FzD3a6onzZbk4u1LmDTn6uJLAcbyX6Ft-t48jkE2MGvsxR-6MI&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=AFF3FJ0EAAAA&_nc_gid=ils4CotxPKZRRaWxS-Fp8Q&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQQTU2Gs5nvTZ_huMx_hoIwhBJimWspmHSbhzNdgyeFGwA&oe=6B036965"}},"caption":{"id":"","text":"The @bcccuny men's soccer team will look to extend its winning streak to four matches, as the Broncos will host @sunyulstermsoc this afternoon at Ohio Field. Start-time is scheduled for 4:00pm. Let's go Broncos! #MatchDay #bronx  #NJCAARegionXV ##NCAA","created_time":null,"from":null},"video":null,"user":{"id":"17841406822028048","full_name":"Bronx CC Athletics","profile_picture":"https://scontent-dfw5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t51.2885-15/210055709_961197861382577_4747689542934436102_n.jpg?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7d201b&_nc_ohc=GjmPO4eT2CEQ7kNvwFbOoYE&_nc_oc=Adp0yh_Pvl1exqJXA8E8UkNzy3DWJSuMR7Nrcqkohztr05okhZj5HOAyzhtSsaMADqM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.xx&edm=AJ-jyNUEAAAA&oh=00_AQQIMe0NXOnSg09n0trO0nVGB0RtsjUTSmvOuvTzPfXNAw&oe=6B035F61","username":"bronxathletics"},"date":"2026-10-08T09:03:36-05:00","created_time":1791450216.0},{"content_id":"18132295063670265","content_title":"The Bronx Community College Broncos continued their impressive turnaround on Tuesday afternoon, cruising to a 5-2 victory over the Queensborough Community College Tigers at Ohio Field.\n\nThe victory marked Bronx's third consecutive triumph and fourth win in its last five contests, as the Broncos have quickly reversed their fortunes after opening the season with an 0-2-1 record. Bronx improved to 4-3-1 on the season with the win, while Queensborough fell to 1-8.\n\nFive different players scored goals for the Broncos, including Omar Sillah, Fnu Eselecha Ndemalalue, David Santa, Hanif Soule, and Tawfiq Amin. \n\nTo read the full recap, visit the official website of the Broncos at BronxBroncos.com!","content_date":"2026-10-07T12:25:43-05:00","content_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeM5Bc5pPD3/","content_image_url":"https://scontent-dfw5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/839475286_18387042016227401_2691126540922548251_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=TduGT9JpMIoQ7kNvwGL1Etl&_nc_oc=AdrlaRsVt6MmXTZvb2QQmKYritYtEuwBphlu2hTuCBGnB-BWFO8qrRBsu8P7pkcaRLM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.cdninstagram.com&edm=AFF3FJ0EAAAA&_nc_gid=ils4CotxPKZRRaWxS-Fp8Q&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQRP9kTWvgddhca59D5o69ZPAMgrY5a1m5CgCFLWyyJ3Mg&oe=6B036941","link":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeM5Bc5pPD3/","id":"18132295063670265","tags":[],"comments":[],"likes":{"count":53},"images":{"thumbnail":null,"low_resolution":{"width":null,"height":null,"url":"https://scontent-dfw5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/839475286_18387042016227401_2691126540922548251_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=TduGT9JpMIoQ7kNvwGL1Etl&_nc_oc=AdrlaRsVt6MmXTZvb2QQmKYritYtEuwBphlu2hTuCBGnB-BWFO8qrRBsu8P7pkcaRLM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.cdninstagram.com&edm=AFF3FJ0EAAAA&_nc_gid=ils4CotxPKZRRaWxS-Fp8Q&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQRP9kTWvgddhca59D5o69ZPAMgrY5a1m5CgCFLWyyJ3Mg&oe=6B036941"},"standard_resolution":{"width":null,"height":null,"url":"https://scontent-dfw5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/839475286_18387042016227401_2691126540922548251_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=TduGT9JpMIoQ7kNvwGL1Etl&_nc_oc=AdrlaRsVt6MmXTZvb2QQmKYritYtEuwBphlu2hTuCBGnB-BWFO8qrRBsu8P7pkcaRLM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.cdninstagram.com&edm=AFF3FJ0EAAAA&_nc_gid=ils4CotxPKZRRaWxS-Fp8Q&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQRP9kTWvgddhca59D5o69ZPAMgrY5a1m5CgCFLWyyJ3Mg&oe=6B036941"}},"caption":{"id":"","text":"The Bronx Community College Broncos continued their impressive turnaround on Tuesday afternoon, cruising to a 5-2 victory over the Queensborough Community College Tigers at Ohio Field.\n\nThe victory marked Bronx's third consecutive triumph and fourth win in its last five contests, as the Broncos have quickly reversed their fortunes after opening the season with an 0-2-1 record. Bronx improved to 4-3-1 on the season with the win, while Queensborough fell to 1-8.\n\nFive different players scored goals for the Broncos, including Omar Sillah, Fnu Eselecha Ndemalalue, David Santa, Hanif Soule, and Tawfiq Amin. \n\nTo read the full recap, visit the official website of the Broncos at BronxBroncos.com!","created_time":null,"from":null},"video":null,"user":{"id":"17841406822028048","full_name":"Bronx CC Athletics","profile_picture":"https://scontent-dfw5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t51.2885-15/210055709_961197861382577_4747689542934436102_n.jpg?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7d201b&_nc_ohc=GjmPO4eT2CEQ7kNvwFbOoYE&_nc_oc=Adp0yh_Pvl1exqJXA8E8Uk