llege All-Sportsmanship Team.\n\nThe three selections highlight the contributions of the Broncos' student-athletes both on and off the field. Santa and Sillah's offensive production helped lead the way for Bronx Community College, while Vazquez's sportsmanship reflected the character and respect that the program strives to uphold.\n\nAll three of these young men played a pivotal role in helping the Broncos reach the NJCAA Region XV Tournament for the first time since 2022.\n\nCongratulations to David Santa, Omar Sillah, and Santiago Vazquez on their well-earned recognition!","created_time":null,"from":null},"video":null,"user":{"id":"17841406822028048","full_name":"Bronx CC Athletics","profile_picture":"https://scontent-dfw5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t51.2885-15/210055709_961197861382577_4747689542934436102_n.jpg?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7d201b&_nc_ohc=GjmPO4eT2CEQ7kNvwFbOoYE&_nc_oc=Adp0yh_Pvl1exqJXA8E8UkNzy3DWJSuMR7Nrcqkohztr05okhZj5HOAyzhtSsaMADqM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.xx&edm=AJ-jyNUEAAAA&oh=00_AQQIMe0NXOnSg09n0trO0nVGB0RtsjUTSmvOuvTzPfXNAw&oe=6B035F61","username":"bronxathletics"},"date":"2026-10-27T09:21:18-05:00","created_time":1793092878.0}],"mode":"web"};
