g&oe=6B035F16","link":"https://www.facebook.com/319384001504847","category":"Campus Building","website":"http://www.bcc.cuny.edu/athletics/","username":"BronxCommunityCollegeAthletics","description":"","can_post":"","type":""}},{"content_id":"319384001504847_1675833607884576","content_title":"The Bronx Community College men's soccer team's offensive chemistry has continued to blossom as the season has progressed, with the Broncos earning recent home triumphs over the SUNY Orange Colts and Dutchess Falcons. With the wins, Bronx is now 3-3-1 on the 2026 campaign!\n\n<a href=\"https://bronxbroncos.com/news/2026/9/25/mens-soccer-bronx-rides-offensive-surge-to-pair-of-home-victories-over-colts-falcons.asp\">https://bronxbroncos.com/news/2026/9/25/mens-soccer-bronx-rides-offensive-surge-to-pair-of-home-victories-over-colts-falcons.asp</a>","content_date":"2026-09-25T10:35:57-05:00","content_url":"https://www.facebook.com/477122557755693/posts/1675833607884576","content_image_url":"https://external-dfw5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/emg1/v/t13/6841459618170915337?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.sidearmdev.com%2Ffit%3Furl%3Dhttps%253a%252f%252fdxbhsrqyrr690.cloudfront.net%252fsidearm.nextgen.sites%252fbcccuny.sidearmsports.com%252fimages%252f2026%252f9%252f25%252fnewwwww_1920x1081.png%26height%3D450%26width%3D800%26type%3Djpeg&fb_obo=1&utld=sidearmdev.com&_nc_ht=external-dfw5-2.xx.fbcdn.net&ccb=18-1&_nc_gid=slmNtU_5Q6w9ImB9dMXsrA&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=3&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQINlSH3l3eiYsyJbACJhanXDcqcuv3gLBsQ-yThWt6Q2HrSTDInTwlPlHl2tb6hNcTlRen0&stp=dst-emg0_fr_q75_tt6&ur=50234c&_nc_sid=64c8fc&oh=06_Q3_FAfQjkaoj-zLbHfCR1ijw5iUq_nPFdGji3zInnzclSlTA&oe=6AFF9CBF","id":"319384001504847_1675833607884576","from":{"Key":"319384001504847","Value":"Bronx CC Athletics"},"message":"The Bronx Community College men's soccer team's offensive chemistry has continued to blossom as the season has progressed, with the Broncos earning recent home triumphs over the SUNY Orange Colts and Dutchess 