84001504847_1663297895804814","from":{"Key":"319384001504847","Value":"Bronx CC Athletics"},"message":"The Bronx Community College men's soccer team picked up a thrilling victory on Saturday afternoon, netting four second half goals to put away the Hawks of Rockland by a score of 5-3 at Ohio Field in the Bronx!\n\n<a href=\"https://bronxbroncos.com/news/2026/9/13/mens-soccer-broncos-use-second-half-scoring-barrage-to-defeat-rockland-5-3-at-ohio-field.aspx\">https://bronxbroncos.com/news/2026/9/13/mens-soccer-broncos-use-second-half-scoring-barrage-to-defeat-rockland-5-3-at-ohio-field.aspx</a>","privacy":{"Key":"Public","Value":"EVERYONE"},"type":"","description":"","full_picture":"","link":"","created_time":"2026-09-13T05:39:16-05:00","updated_time":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","is_published":true,"is_hidden":false,"permalink_url":"https://www.facebook.com/477122557755693/posts/1663297895804814","like_count":"1","link_to_post":"https://facebook.com/319384001504847_1663297895804814","page":{"id":"319384001504847","name":"Bronx CC Athletics","picture":"https://scontent-dfw5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-1/211199869_3901670216609523_8685976092319493666_n.jpg?stp=cp0_dst-jpg_s50x50_tt6&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=f907e8&_nc_ohc=QiSCedH5C28Q7kNvwHvxVGk&_nc_oc=AdrhCWgJfsEYTBzejFjnHEmlYV3An3cleWXCidYs4pXV4aZTLihdqJ3d52aCq8DTvmM&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.xx&edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&_nc_gid=7dFkZi6zXr-QwSGEvcpHEQ&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLGMwnDDl2nfx9IOgY1zdunFZzdyizi0nniQKw9twwVfV6EklJMzxEdUsV5PPJ6xIN76EZ_&oh=00_AQSGyebjL1FfOU6f7IQ7OmghJ8_R08kRTHdd43oWuduukg&oe=6B035F16","link":"https://www.facebook.com/319384001504847","category":"Campus Building","website":"http://www.bcc.cuny.edu/athletics/","username":"BronxCommunityCollegeAthletics","description":"","can_post":"","type":""}},{"content_id":"319384001504847_1661423862658884","content_title":"Today, we pause to remember and honor the lives lost on September 11, 2001.\n\nWe remember the innocent victims whose lives were taken, the families and loved ones who continue to carry their memories, and the countless first responders, firefighters, law enforcement officers, military personnel, medical professionals, and everyday heroes who demonstrated extraordinary courage and selflessness in the face of unimaginable tragedy.\n\nTheir courage, sacrifice, and compassion will never be forgotten.\n\nWe remember. We honor. We will never forget.\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/PatriotDay\">#PatriotDay</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/September11\">#September11</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/NeverForget\">#NeverForget</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/WeRemember\">#WeRemember</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/HonorAndRemember\">#HonorAndRemember</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/FirstResponders\">#FirstResponders</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/Heroes\">#Heroes</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/911Memorial\">#911Memorial</a>","content_date":"2026-09-11T05:15:50-05:00","content_url":"https://www.facebook.com/477122557755693/posts/1661423862658884","content_image_url":"https://scontent-dfw6-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/805027573_1661423749325562_2927528018638046252_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=127cfc&_nc_ohc=biAo_iQT_P8Q7kNvwFadgNM&_nc_oc=Adq5__mcE5gt5Gsx9BJZETV-Rq19qkRlIQg18Chkt7lzYrGFXMtfEHHxm8NN63cP0w0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.xx&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=slmNtU_5Q6w9ImB9dMXsrA&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLSw4PAGsvIBhDu9c_QaD7HzBFQb6uZ2Bp4LJyzPiJVV6Tz_JtaTp2x7MvGIsvVQjX0naqr&oh=00_AQQ4FYs2abK4kQJct3GwEK9p9qhDtvaiQcmMDq8U_imVSA&oe=6B0378B9","id":"319384001504847_1661423862658884","from":{"Key":"319384001504847","Value":"Bronx CC Athletics"},"message":"Today, we pause to remember and honor the lives lost on September 11, 2001.\n\nWe remember the innocent victims whose lives were taken, the families and loved ones who continue to carry their memories, and the countless first responders, firefighters, law enforcement officers, military personnel, medical professionals, and everyday heroes who demonstrated extraordinary courage and selflessness in the face of unimaginable tragedy.\n\nTheir courage, sacrifice, and compassion will never be forgotten.\n\nWe remember. We honor. We will never forget.\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/PatriotDay\">#PatriotDay</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/September11\">#September11</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/NeverForget\">#NeverForget</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/WeRemember\">#WeRemember</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/HonorAndRemember\">#HonorAndRemember</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/FirstResponders\">#FirstResponders</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/Heroes\">#Heroes</a> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/911Memorial\">#911Memorial</a>","privacy":{"Key":"Public","Value":"EVERYONE"},"type":"","description":"","full_picture":"https://scontent-dfw6-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/805027573_1661423749325562_2927528018638046252_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=127cfc&_nc_ohc=biAo_iQT_P8Q7kNvwFadgNM&_nc_oc=Adq5__mcE5gt5Gsx9BJZETV-Rq19qkRlIQg18Chkt7lzYrGFXMtfEHHxm8NN63cP0w0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.xx&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=slmNtU_5Q6w9ImB9dMXsrA&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLSw4PAGsvIBhDu9c_QaD7HzBFQb6uZ2Bp4LJyzPiJVV6Tz_JtaTp2x7MvGIsvVQjX0naqr&oh=00_AQQ4FYs2abK4kQJct3GwEK9p9qhDtvaiQcmMDq8U_imVSA&oe=6B0378B9","link":"","created_time":"2026-09-11T05:15:50-05:00","updated_time":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","is_published":true,"is_hidden":false,"permalink_url":"https://www.facebook.com/477122557755693/posts/1661423862658884","like_count":"0","link_to_post":"https://facebook.com/319384001504847_1661423862658884","page":{"id":"319384001504847","name":"Bronx CC Athletics","picture":"https://scontent-dfw5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-1/